; Original Blitz3D side of the bigmesh benchmark: the timer has milliseconds only, there is no culling setting and no clusters (0).

Function BenchMicros()
	Return MilliSecs() * 1000
End Function

Function BenchCulling(camera)
End Function

Function BenchClusters()
	Return 0
End Function
